{
 "subs": [
  {
   "text": "After the earthquake,",
   "t0": 0.8,
   "t1": 2.212,
   "end": 2.212,
   "n": 19
  },
  {
   "text": "a fault opened on",
   "t0": 2.212,
   "t1": 3.421,
   "end": 3.421,
   "n": 14
  },
  {
   "text": "Amigara Mountain.",
   "t0": 3.421,
   "t1": 4.564,
   "end": 4.814,
   "n": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "The rock was full of holes.",
   "t0": 4.964,
   "t1": 6.807,
   "end": 6.807,
   "n": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "Hundreds of them.",
   "t0": 6.807,
   "t1": 7.967,
   "end": 7.967,
   "n": 15
  },
  {
   "text": "Shaped like people.",
   "t0": 7.967,
   "t1": 9.264,
   "end": 9.564,
   "n": 17
  },
  {
   "text": "And everyone who came found one",
   "t0": 9.714,
   "t1": 11.674,
   "end": 11.674,
   "n": 26
  },
  {
   "text": "shaped exactly like them.",
   "t0": 11.674,
   "t1": 13.206,
   "end": 13.655999999999999,
   "n": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "\"this hole was made for me,\" a man said.",
   "t0": 13.706,
   "t1": 16.168,
   "end": 16.368000000000002,
   "n": 32
  },
  {
   "text": "And he stepped inside.",
   "t0": 16.518,
   "t1": 17.841,
   "end": 18.291,
   "n": 19
  },
  {
   "text": "No light could reach the end of it.",
   "t0": 18.441,
   "t1": 20.324,
   "end": 20.774,
   "n": 28
  },
  {
   "text": "Yoshida found hers next.",
   "t0": 21.024,
   "t1": 22.809,
   "end": 22.809,
   "n": 21
  },
  {
   "text": "She couldn't stop staring.",
   "t0": 22.809,
   "t1": 24.668,
   "end": 24.968,
   "n": 23
  },
  {
   "text": "Owaki pulled her away.",
   "t0": 25.118,
   "t1": 26.607,
   "end": 26.607,
   "n": 19
  },
  {
   "text": "But on the path down, he saw it.",
   "t0": 26.607,
   "t1": 28.705,
   "end": 29.055,
   "n": 25
  },
  {
   "text": "His own shape.",
   "t0": 29.205,
   "t1": 30.369,
   "end": 30.369,
   "n": 12
  },
  {
   "text": "Calling him.",
   "t0": 30.369,
   "t1": 31.366,
   "end": 31.716,
   "n": 11
  },
  {
   "text": "Months later, they dug",
   "t0": 33.066,
   "t1": 34.413,
   "end": 34.413,
   "n": 19
  },
  {
   "text": "into the other side of the mountain.",
   "t0": 34.413,
   "t1": 36.618,
   "end": 37.068000000000005,
   "n": 30
  },
  {
   "text": "The holes there weren't shaped",
   "t0": 37.218,
   "t1": 38.891,
   "end": 38.891,
   "n": 26
  },
  {
   "text": "like people anymore.",
   "t0": 38.891,
   "t1": 40.006,
   "end": 40.456,
   "n": 18
  }
 ],
